304
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:47,600
Is that why he's acting so weird? He's jealous?
這就是他最近行為詭異的原因嗎？ 他在吃醋嗎？

305
00:21:47,770 --> 00:21:48,930
Oh, my God, that is crazy.
喔，我的天，這真是太瘋狂了

306
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:51,500
- It's not like I'm attracted to Jeffrey. - So what?
-又不是說我喜歡上傑佛瑞 -那又怎樣？

307
00:21:51,670 --> 00:21:56,540
Being funny is Chandler's thing. Like Ross' thing is..
風趣是錢德的專長 就像羅斯的專長就是…

308
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:03,340
Science?
科學？

309
00:22:03,620 --> 00:22:07,020
Academia? Being a good father?
學術？好父親？

310
00:22:11,260 --> 00:22:13,730
- I can't believe he's that upset. - Are you kidding?
-我不敢相信他在不高興 -你在開玩笑嗎？

311
00:22:13,890 --> 00:22:18,490
That's like Chandler saying he met someone who was more uptight than you.
這就像是錢德告訴你他遇到 比你更急躁不安的人一樣

312
00:22:20,330 --> 00:22:24,460
- Excuse me? - I'm sorry. Sorry. More controlling than you.
-什麼？ -抱歉，對不起，應該是比你更控制狂

313
00:22:25,940 --> 00:22:28,030
- Well, that's better. - Yeah, okay.
-嗯，好多了 -是的，好了

314
00:22:28,210 --> 00:22:30,540
You have to do some damage control.
你要做一些事來彌補

315
00:22:30,710 --> 00:22:33,150
Because he's feeling like..
因為他覺得…

316
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:37,210
What are you guys talking about?
你們在說些什麼？

317
00:22:38,150 --> 00:22:41,850
Rachel and I hired a male nanny.
瑞秋跟我雇了一個男保姆

318
00:22:42,290 --> 00:22:45,420
You got a man who's a nanny?
你雇了一個男人當保姆？

319
00:22:45,590 --> 00:22:46,890
You got a "manny"?
你雇了一個「男保」？

320
00:22:56,570 --> 00:22:58,560
You know, I don't mind a male nanny..
你知道的，我是不介意男保姆…

321
00:22:58,740 --> 00:23:00,570
but I do draw the line at male wet nurse.
但是我倒是很介意男的擦澡護士

322
00:23:06,280 --> 00:23:08,410
You are on a roll, mister!
你真是太酷了，老兄！

323
00:23:09,250 --> 00:23:12,180
If I'd known you guys were coming over, I would've brought more pizza.
如果我知道你們要過來 我就會多買幾份批薩

324
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:18,650
Okay! Okay! Stop it, you! You stop it!
好了！好啦！停止，你們！ 你們停止！

325
00:23:21,030 --> 00:23:22,890
What is so funny about that?
那有什麼好笑的呢？

326
00:23:27,900 --> 00:23:29,300
Monica?
莫妮卡？

327
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:33,540
I don't know, it's.. Just the way you say it.
我不知道，就是… 你說的方式很好笑

328
00:23:33,710 --> 00:23:37,670
I mean, you're funny. You have that funny thing. You're a funny guy!
我是說，你很風趣 你有風趣的特質，就是很風趣的人！

329
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:43,850
Did you tell her what we talked about?
你跟她說我們談過的事嗎？

330
00:23:52,930 --> 00:23:56,730
So those were pity laughs? Pity laughs?!
所以那些是同情的笑聲嗎？ 同情笑聲！

331
00:23:57,430 --> 00:23:59,760
Honey, listen.
親愛的，聽著

332
00:24:00,130 --> 00:24:02,190
You have nothing to worry about with Jeffrey.
你根本不需要擔心傑佛瑞

333
00:24:02,370 --> 00:24:04,500
Oh, yeah? Is he funnier than me?
喔，是嗎？他比我風趣嗎？

334
00:24:04,870 --> 00:24:07,360
Well, you're different funny.
你們風趣的方式不同

335
00:24:07,540 --> 00:24:09,870
I mean, you're more sarcastic.
我是說，你是比較挖苦式的

336
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:13,600
Well, he does bits and impressions and limericks.
嗯，他是做一些模仿跟打油詩等等的

337
00:24:14,010 --> 00:24:15,040
I do limericks.
我也會打油詩啊！

338
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:20,710
There once was a man named Chandler whose wife made him die inside.
有一個叫做錢德的男的 他老婆讓他死在裡頭

339
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:24,890
Honey, you know I think you're hilarious.
親愛的，你知道我認為你超好笑的

340
00:24:25,060 --> 00:24:26,960
You know that joke you told me last week?
你知道你上星期告訴我的笑話嗎？

341
00:24:27,130 --> 00:24:30,030
The one about Jerry Lewis and the girl with the lazy eye.
傑瑞路易斯跟有惺忪睡眼女生的笑話

342
00:24:30,330 --> 00:24:31,760
That slayed me.
那真是笑死我了

343
00:24:32,230 --> 00:24:36,330
Hey! I made up that joke and told it to you.
嗨！那是我編出來告訴你的

344
00:24:40,070 --> 00:24:44,440
- Not knowing when to shut up. - Yep, that's my thing.
-不知道什麼時候該閉嘴 -是的，那就是我的專長

345
00:24:47,280 --> 00:24:50,580
So how many guys have your key?
有多少男人有你家的鑰匙呢？

346
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:53,650
It's not as bad as it looks.
實際情況並不像看起來這樣糟

347
00:24:54,020 --> 00:24:55,890
I was saying goodbye to an old friend.
我只是在跟一個老朋友道別

348
00:24:56,260 --> 00:24:58,250
Your lipstick's on his mouth.
你的口紅都在他唇上了

349
00:24:59,190 --> 00:25:02,160
We just happen to wear the same shade.
我們只是剛好都用相同的口紅

350
00:25:03,460 --> 00:25:06,590
No, David and I did used to go out.
不，我跟大衛以前在一起過

351
00:25:06,970 --> 00:25:11,900
But years ago. And he lives in Minsk. He's only in town for a couple days.
但是是幾年前了，而且他住在明斯克 他只是回來幾天而已

352
00:25:12,610 --> 00:25:14,270
- Did you..? - No. No.
-你有沒有…？ -不，不

353
00:25:14,440 --> 00:25:16,100
- Kiss him? - Oh, well, yeah.
-親他？ -喔，嗯，有

354
00:25:17,740 --> 00:25:20,870
Yes, but.. Look, she really likes you.
是的，但是… 聽著，她真的很喜歡你

355
00:25:21,050 --> 00:25:24,310
In fact, she stopped what was a pretty amazing kiss.
事實上，她停止了一個相當美好的親吻

356
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:28,010
- David, David, David. - No, no. He should hear this.
-大衛，大衛，大衛 -不，不，他應該要知道的

357
00:25:28,190 --> 00:25:31,620
I don't think you realize just how lucky you are, fella.
我不認為你知道你有多幸運，老兄

358
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:34,190
- Don't point your finger at me! - Why?
-別用手指指著我！ -為什麼？

359
00:25:34,360 --> 00:25:35,920
What are you gonna do about it?
你要怎樣呢？

360
00:25:36,330 --> 00:25:39,030
Well, I'll show you what I'm gonna do about it.
好的，我會讓你瞧瞧我能怎樣

361
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:41,690
- Oh, really? Really? - You want some of that?
-喔，真的嗎？真的嗎？ -你想試試看嗎？

362
00:25:45,570 --> 00:25:48,700
Stop it! Stop it! Before someone gets really hurt!
停止！停止！ 在有人受傷前快停止！

363
00:25:51,410 --> 00:25:53,880
Here, David, you should just go.
拿去，大衛，你應該離開了

364
00:25:54,050 --> 00:25:55,340
All right.
好的

365
00:25:56,580 --> 00:26:01,280
But if I ever do come back from Minsk, well, you just better watch out.
但是如果我從明斯克回來 你最好小心一點

366
00:26:01,660 --> 00:26:04,720
- If I go to Minsk, you better watch out. - Oh, you're going to Minsk?
-如果我去明斯克，你也小心點 -喔，你會去明斯克嗎？

367
00:26:04,930 --> 00:26:07,760
- Well, I might. - Really?
-喔，或許會 -真的嗎？

368
00:26:07,930 --> 00:26:11,260
Well, if you do, come in the spring. It's just lovely there.
如果你要去，最好在春天 春天是很宜人的

369
00:26:11,930 --> 00:26:13,490
I've heard that, actually.
事實上我有聽說過

370
00:26:13,670 --> 00:26:16,100
Okay, well, guys?
好了，你們

371
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:19,030
- Goodbye, Phoebe. - Bye.
-再見，菲比 -再見

372
00:26:19,270 --> 00:26:22,800
- Hey, what, are you kidding me? - Right-o. Right-o.
-嘿，你在開玩笑嗎？ -沒事，沒事

373
00:26:26,510 --> 00:26:28,450
Take good care of her.
好好照顧她

374
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:33,450
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
我很抱歉，非常抱歉

375
00:26:33,620 --> 00:26:36,950
If you want your key back, I totally understand.
如果你想拿回你的鑰匙 我完全理解

376
00:26:38,530 --> 00:26:41,620
- It's never gonna happen again, right? - Right. Never. I swear.
-這不會再發生了，對不對？ -沒錯，我發誓絕不

377
00:26:45,430 --> 00:26:49,490
I just want to say, if you do ever come to Minsk, that's my number.
我只想說，如果你來明斯克 這是我的號碼

378
00:26:49,670 --> 00:26:53,130
We'll party up Vladnik-style.
我們可以以俄羅斯方式開派對

379
00:27:09,060 --> 00:27:10,650
Yeah! All right!
是！好的！

380
00:27:11,020 --> 00:27:15,220
Hey, Ross! Check it out! Sandy taught me "Hot Cross Buns"!
嘿！羅斯！快過來！ 看珊帝教我吹「甜蜜家庭」

381
00:27:15,830 --> 00:27:18,350
Really? Sounded like "Three Blind Mice."
真的嗎？聽起來像是「三隻瞎眼鼠」

382
00:27:18,730 --> 00:27:21,500
- "Three Blind Mice" goes like this. - I swear to God.
-「三隻瞎眼鼠」是這樣 -別逼我

383
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:28,900
- Who's up for puppets? - Me! I'm up for puppets!
-誰想要看布偶秀呢？ -我！我要看布偶秀！

384
00:27:29,080 --> 00:27:31,910
Well, please welcome:
喔，請歡迎…

385
00:27:32,080 --> 00:27:34,050
The Snufflebumps!
鼻塞小子！

386
00:27:34,210 --> 00:27:37,880
Who wants to be Mr. Wigglemunch and who's gonna be the Grumpus?
誰想要當搖擺先生 還有誰想當小挑剔？

387
00:27:38,050 --> 00:27:43,250
How exactly is a 2-month-old supposed to appreciate puppets?
一個兩歲大的嬰兒怎麼看得懂布偶呢？

388
00:27:43,620 --> 00:27:47,750
Studies show that the movement and colors help their cerebral development.
研究報告顯示動作跟顏色 可以幫助大腦發展

389
00:27:47,930 --> 00:27:51,490
The whimsical characters are just for us.
這些古怪的角色只是要讓我們笑而已

390
00:27:55,570 --> 00:27:58,440
I want to be Mr. Wigglemunch!
我想要當搖擺先生！

391
00:27:59,610 --> 00:28:00,870
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

392
00:28:01,110 --> 00:28:03,800
Well, I guess we know who's gonna be the Grumpus!
嗯，我想我知道誰要當小挑剔了！

393
00:28:09,380 --> 00:28:11,940
- That was kind of rude. - Oh, I'm sorry.
-你實在是有點沒禮貌 -喔，我很抱歉

394
00:28:12,120 --> 00:28:16,150
Please apologize to Sandy and the Snufflebumps for me.
請代我跟珊帝還有鼻塞小子道歉

395
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:19,660
- You know, he was just doing his job. - You know what?
-你知道的，他只是在做份內的事 -你知道嗎？

396
00:28:19,830 --> 00:28:26,060
I'm sorry I'm the only one who isn't in love with Gary Poppins out there.
我很抱歉我是唯一 一個不喜歡《陳鴻作菜》的人

397
00:28:28,540 --> 00:28:31,100
But I just.. I can't go through with this.
但是我只是… 我就是沒有辦法接受

398
00:28:31,470 --> 00:28:32,940
- Come on. - No! You know what?
-別這樣 -不！你知道嗎？

399
00:28:33,170 --> 00:28:38,130
I would never force you to hire someone you were this uncomfortable with.
我絕對不會強迫你僱用你不喜歡用的人

400
00:28:41,750 --> 00:28:43,680
That's true.
那倒是真的

401
00:28:43,850 --> 00:28:45,040
Thank you.
謝謝你

402
00:28:45,290 --> 00:28:47,620
You want to fire him, so you have to go do it.
是你要解雇他的，你去跟他說

403
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:56,290
So you see, Wigglemunch, that's why it's important to share.
所以，搖擺先生 這就是分享的重要

404
00:28:58,630 --> 00:29:01,930
I am learning so much from you.
我從你身上學到好多

405
00:29:06,840 --> 00:29:08,100
Well, I'm off to Tulsa.
好了，我要去土爾沙了

406
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:11,710
So if your maitre d' friend has any funny Oklahoma jokes..
如果你的領班朋友有任何 好笑的奧克拉荷馬笑話…

407
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:16,650
tell him to e-mail me at www-dot-ha-ha-not-so-much-dot-com!
叫他寄電子郵件到 WWW點，一點都不好笑，點COM！

408
00:29:18,850 --> 00:29:20,440
Honey, you can relax.
親愛的，你可以放輕鬆了

409
00:29:20,650 --> 00:29:24,020
Last night at work Jeffrey told this really sexist joke.
昨晚工作時傑佛瑞說了個 很性別歧視的笑話

410
00:29:24,190 --> 00:29:27,130
- After that, not so funny anymore. - Really?
-從此之後，再也沒有那麼好笑了 -真的？

411
00:29:27,490 --> 00:29:31,120
See, that's the thing. You gotta keep it smart, people!
瞧，都是這樣的 要學聰明一點的！

412
00:29:32,370 --> 00:29:34,630
Don't miss that flight. You know I love you.
別錯過班機，你知道我愛你

413
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:37,160
I love you too.
我也愛你

414
00:29:37,370 --> 00:29:41,140
- And I like you as a friend. - Right.
-而我像朋友一樣喜歡你 -沒錯

415
00:29:41,310 --> 00:29:43,830
- See you later. - See you.
-再見 -再見

416
00:29:45,410 --> 00:29:48,900
- Did the guy really make that joke? - No, he still kills me.
-那個男的真的有說那個笑話嗎？ -沒有，他還是讓我捧腹大笑

417
00:29:49,120 --> 00:29:53,380
Last night he had me laughing so hard, I swear a little pee came out.
我發誓昨晚他讓我笑到 真的有點尿跑出來

418
00:30:01,730 --> 00:30:02,890
Here goes.
好了

419
00:30:03,130 --> 00:30:06,390
I can't watch. It's like firing Elmo.
我沒有辦法看，這就像開除愛摩一樣

420
00:30:11,040 --> 00:30:12,440
Sandy? Hi.
珊帝？嗨

421
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:14,370
- Hi. - We..
-嗨 -我們…

422
00:30:14,540 --> 00:30:16,570
We kind of need to talk.
我們可能需要談談

423
00:30:20,580 --> 00:30:22,880
I'm afraid it's not working out.
我想恐怕這樣是行不通的

424
00:30:28,020 --> 00:30:33,050
I mean, Rachel and I think you are great with Emma.
我是說 瑞秋跟我認為你帶艾□實在是很棒

425
00:30:33,230 --> 00:30:36,460
- We just feel.. - You! You feel!
-我們只是覺得… -你！是你覺得！

426
00:30:37,360 --> 00:30:41,860
I just feel..
我只是覺得…

427
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:45,400
that the chemistry isn't right. I'm sorry.
磁場不和，我很抱歉

428
00:30:45,570 --> 00:30:48,230
We're more than happy to give you a good recommendation.
我們很樂意幫你寫推薦信的

429
00:30:48,610 --> 00:30:52,810
No, that's okay. I had a lot of offers from other families.
不，沒關係，我還有很多其他的家庭 要我過去幫忙

430
00:30:52,980 --> 00:30:55,280
I just picked you guys because..
我挑選你們是因為…

431
00:30:55,450 --> 00:30:59,540
- I liked you the best. - Oh, damn you, Geller!
-我最喜歡你們 -喔，該死的，蓋勒！

432
00:31:02,790 --> 00:31:05,780
Anyway, well I'm glad there's no hard feelings.
好了，我很高興沒有任何不愉快

433
00:31:06,190 --> 00:31:10,820
None at all. You need to be happy with whoever is in your home.
一點也沒有，你們需要跟一個 能相處融洽的人才行

434
00:31:11,060 --> 00:31:14,590
Although, if you don't mind telling me..
不過，如果你不介意告訴我…

435
00:31:14,770 --> 00:31:18,230
what was the problem? Maybe it's something I can work on in the future.
問題是出在哪裡呢？ 或許是我在將來可以改進的地方

436
00:31:18,940 --> 00:31:24,570
No, you know, it's nothing you did. It's my issue.
不，不關你的事，是我的問題

437
00:31:25,710 --> 00:31:27,270
What is it?
是什麼呢？

438
00:31:29,750 --> 00:31:31,340
Please?
拜託？

439
00:31:34,950 --> 00:31:41,420
You know, I'm just not that comfortable with a guy who's as sensitive as you.
我只不過是不習慣 跟像你一樣敏感的男人相處

440
00:31:42,460 --> 00:31:43,490
That's fair.
可以諒解

441
00:31:44,530 --> 00:31:48,160
Although, can I ask, why do you think that is?
但是，我可以問你為什麼會是這樣嗎？

442
00:31:48,800 --> 00:31:50,630
Why? I don't know.
為什麼？我不知道

443
00:31:58,340 --> 00:32:00,870
Maybe because of my father?
或許是我父親的緣故

444
00:32:05,250 --> 00:32:07,740
You know, when I was growing up, he was a tough guy.
在我的成長過程中 他總是像個硬漢一樣

445
00:32:09,190 --> 00:32:13,850
You know, and as a kid, I wasn't the athlete I am now.
小時候，我不像現在一樣這麼有運動感

446
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:17,960
I play squash!
我會玩壁球！

447
00:32:21,530 --> 00:32:27,130
Anyway, I always got the feeling he thought I was too sensitive.
反正，我總是覺得他認為我太敏感

448
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,970
That must have been hard.
那一定很難受

449
00:32:30,510 --> 00:32:32,540
It was hard.
的確是很難受

450
00:32:33,810 --> 00:32:39,010
I remember I was in my bedroom, playing with my dinosaurs..
我記得有一次我在房間 跟我的恐龍玩…

451
00:32:40,090 --> 00:32:41,420
Playing and learning.
是一邊玩一邊學習

452
00:32:44,090 --> 00:32:49,930
And my father walks in and says, "What are you doing with those things?
然後我父親走了進來說 你是在跟那些東西做什麼？

453
00:32:50,160 --> 00:32:56,070
What's wrong with you? Why aren't you outside playing like a real boy?"
你有什麼不對勁？為什麼你不能去外面 像真正的男生一樣玩呢？

454
00:32:56,500 --> 00:32:59,670
- But you are a real boy. - I know I am!
-但是你是真正的男生啊 -我知道我是的！

455
00:33:01,940 --> 00:33:07,070
And when it's summer and it's hot, why can't you wear a tank top?!
夏天很熱的時候 為什麼不能穿背心裝呢？

456
00:33:08,450 --> 00:33:14,680
It's all right. Crying is good. It lets the boo-hoos out.
沒關係，哭泣是好事 大聲哭出來吧

457
00:33:17,360 --> 00:33:19,520
Here comes some more!
再哭出來吧！

458
00:33:24,660 --> 00:33:31,160
Emma, one day you're gonna grow up and be a big girl, just like your daddy.
艾□，有天你會長成大女孩 就跟你爹地一樣

459
00:33:36,410 --> 00:33:39,640
And what's the one kind of boat that can never ever sink?
哪一種船是永遠不會沉的船呢？

460
00:33:40,010 --> 00:33:44,810
- What kind? - A friend ship!
-哪一種？ -「友船」（音同友誼）！

461
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:50,020
Wow! You blow my mind!
哇！你真讓我大開眼界！

462
00:33:51,990 --> 00:33:54,020
I gotta go.
我要走了

463
00:33:54,230 --> 00:33:55,990
- How much do I owe you? - Twenty bucks.
-我該給你多少呢？ -二十塊

464
00:33:56,630 --> 00:33:59,860
It's like the cheapest college ever!
就像是史上最便宜的大學了！

465
00:34:00,030 --> 00:34:02,700
- I'll see you tomorrow. - Okay, bye-bye, Skadandy.
-明天見 -好的，掰掰，珊卡丹帝

466
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


467
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
